  <h1>Terms of use</h1>
  <p class="muted">Last updated: October 26, 2026.</p>
  <h2>The service</h2>
  <p>Alcove lets adults chat with original fictional characters whose replies are generated by an AI. Characters are not real people. Replies can be wrong or incomplete and are not medical, legal, financial or psychological advice.</p>
  <h2>Who can use it</h2>
  <p>You must be 18 or older. One account per person.</p>
  <h2>What's not allowed</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Sexual content, and anything involving minors in a sexual or harmful way.</li>
    <li>Harassment, hate, threats, or using Alcove to plan anything illegal.</li>
    <li>Trying to get around the platform's safety rules, or automating access to the service.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We may suspend accounts that break these rules.</p>
  <h2>Credits</h2>
  <p>One credit is used per reply. A reply that fails is refunded automatically. Free credits have no cash value. Paid plans, when available, will have their own conditions.</p>
  <h2>Safety</h2>
  <p>If you are in danger or thinking about hurting yourself, contact your local emergency services or a helpline: 3114 in France, 988 in the US, 116 123 (Samaritans) in the UK and Ireland, or findahelpline.com.</p>
  <h2>Law</h2>
  <p>These terms are governed by French law. Contact: <a href="mailto:contact@victoire-digital.fr">contact@victoire-digital.fr</a>.</p>
